WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.380
Hello, my name is David Brammer with the Fire

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:08.180
Prevention Branch. First, you want to make sure that

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.080
you have a safe way out of your business

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.380
or residence in case the fire becomes uncontrollable.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.320
Second, you want to make sure that your fire

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.520
extinguisher is compatible with the fire that you're experiencing.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.680
Third, store the fire extinguisher in an easy, accessible

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.440
location. And fourth, use the pass method.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.500
Pass is pull the pin, aim the nozzle at

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.280
the base of the fire, squeeze the lever to

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.040
activate the extinguisher, and sweep side to side.
